16. (Currently Amended) The method of claim 13, wherein calculating the secondary pulmonary risk score includes using measurements of the second signal metric obtained sampled only at times when the third signal metric satisfies a specified condition.
17. (Original) The method of claim 13, wherein calculating the secondary pulmonary risk score includes using the second signal metric weighted by the third signal metric.
18. (Original) The method of claim 13, wherein calculating the composite pulmonary risk score includes using a neural network taking the primary and the secondary pulmonary risk scores as input.
19. (Canceled)
20. (Original) The method of claim 13, further comprising initiating or adjusting a therapy to treat a cardiorespiratory disease in accordance with the calculated composite pulmonary risk score.
